{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Multiplayer PVP Mode!\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909570/extras/959763f3911b32bcadd2a65d73bb93e5.poster.avif?t=1762584085\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909570/extras/959763f3911b32bcadd2a65d73bb93e5.webm?t=1762584085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You asked for Poker PVP, we gave you Pawker PVP!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jokers are enhanced, Deity packs have gone wild, Witchcraft cards are infused with insane power - in this mode everything has been increased for a fast paced feline battle!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round is unique leading to the final round: gold on discard? extra discards? plan ahead meow!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See your opponents Jokers and hands, figure out how to stop them and do as much damage as you can! Play meow!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pawker is a supurrr satisfying deckbuilder roguelike where you play as cat adventurers trying to create purrfect combos.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909570/extras/35db799b2cfe40339cbbca138f4358a7.poster.avif?t=1762584085\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909570/extras/35db799b2cfe40339cbbca138f4358a7.webm?t=1762584085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909570/extras/35db799b2cfe40339cbbca138f4358a7.mp4?t=1762584085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crazy memes and special felines are here to help you on your adventure! Build your deck of cats to get as far as you can!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cat roguelike pawker style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique special DUNGEON MEOWDE for you to explore the hidden dungeons and go as far as you can, be careful of the Shadow cats!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play casual or go expert (we aren't kitten you its not easy!)\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909570/extras/9cd051e39fdeca4475cab51247d7938a.poster.avif?t=1762584085\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909570/extras/9cd051e39fdeca4475cab51247d7938a.webm?t=1762584085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909570/extras/9cd051e39fdeca4475cab51247d7938a.mp4?t=1762584085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as different feline adventurers! Are you a Cat-at-arms? or a little Sneakitty? Purrhaps you want to be a wizard and play as Magicat. It's your adventure, have fun meow!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Feline Adventurers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >169 Cat Cards to assist you on your adventures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fur cards, gold cards, and seals to make your cards even stronger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special achievements, what a cat-as-trophy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witchcat cards, Catarots and more!\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909570/extras/383c3147ad4fdddadbb3120ab607c0a7.poster.avif?t=1762584085\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909570/extras/383c3147ad4fdddadbb3120ab607c0a7.webm?t=1762584085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909570/extras/383c3147ad4fdddadbb3120ab607c0a7.mp4?t=1762584085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find all the felines there are in the world! Find the memes and channel your inner cat! Meow meow meow!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A Cat's Journey","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3909570/93940146d7c05bfef1a73bfe94663cdd94afaa41.jpg"},{"name":"A Cat's Life","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3909570/e9d3c9f9beca78b423f827ad1a69db9a63a223e2.jpg"},{"name":"Love Pawker!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3909570/3cdd1e73158605a77a256dc97e0d541c4b1e3dce.jpg"},{"name":"Cat Adoption","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3909570/8548ea05eebbc0455f94f592bf73c90f1064a4e7.jpg"},{"name":"Cats in Line","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3909570/a7ecd6cd461b58c7c1d3ac151fcc53ba0082628a.jpg"},{"name":"Expert Magicat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3909570/03ed10aa56b6df7cb55131963ca9cf3b14457066.jpg"},{"name":"Expert Sneakitty","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3909570/21996b879545edaec1fb207eca0acce73ce5e46a.jpg"},{"name":"Expert Cat-In-Arms","path":"https://cdn.akamai.st