 far as you can, be careful of the Shadow cats!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play casual or go expert (we aren't kitten you its not easy!)\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909570/extras/9cd051e39fdeca4475cab51247d7938a.poster.avif?t=1762584085\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909570/extras/9cd051e39fdeca4475cab51247d7938a.webm?t=1762584085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909570/extras/9cd051e39fdeca4475cab51247d7938a.mp4?t=1762584085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as different feline adventurers! Are you a Cat-at-arms? or a little Sneakitty? Purrhaps you want to be a wizard and play as Magicat. It's your adventure, have fun meow!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Feline Adventurers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >169 Cat Cards to assist you on your adventures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fur cards, gold cards, and seals to make your cards even stronger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special achievements, what a cat-as-trophy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witchcat cards, Catarots and more!\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909570/extras/383c3147ad4fdddadbb3120ab607c0a7.poster.avif?t=1762584085\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909570/extras/383c3147ad4fdddadbb3120ab607c0a7.webm?t=1762584085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\